{
 "about": "Curated motion-capture clips for mocap.retarget_bvh / library.add_mocap. 'file' is relative to mocap.mocap_root() (~/Pixel Pipeline/Mocap or $PIXEL_MOCAP). start/end (seconds) trim a clip; null = the whole take (loops find their own cycle). Sizes from the GitHub contents API (2026-10-13).",
 "sources": {
  "cmu": {
   "name": "CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database, cgspeed (Bruce Hahne) MotionBuilder-friendly BVH conversion",
   "home": "https://mocap.cs.cmu.edu/",
   "mirror": "https://github.com/una-dinosauria/cmu-mocap",
   "licence": "Free for any use; may be included in commercially-sold products; the data itself may not be resold, even converted.",
   "credit": "The data used in this project was obtained from mocap.cs.cmu.edu. The database was created with funding from NSF EIA-0196217.",
   "fps": 120,
   "skip_first": 0.0167,
   "notes": "Frame 1 of every file is an added T-pose (skipped). No clavicle motion; finger joints carry no motion."
  }
 },
